tt-local-generator (0.82.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * fix(engine): the Pipeline Studio per-step model picker now actually routes
    to the picked artgen model. The picker writes the raw server_manager key
    (e.g. "artgen-qwen3-8b") into the node's model input, but
    _artgen_key_for_model only matched the ServerDef --model display string
    (e.g. "Qwen3-8B"), so every picker-driven artgen node silently fell back to
    ARTGEN_DETECT (auto-detect) instead of the chosen model. It now matches the
