    card size.

 -- Taylor Singletary <tsingletary@tenstorrent.com>  Sun, 03 Aug 2026 17:45:00 +0000

tt-local-generator (0.61.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * fix(create): the result pane jumped BELOW the form once generation started
    (most visible with AnimateDiff's wide/tall options). Root cause was pure
    size negotiation in the two-pane FlowBox: (1) the pending card's prompt
    Gtk.Label wrapped but had no max-width-chars, so its natural width was the
    full un-wrapped prompt (~1000px), ballooning the result pane; and (2) a wide
    medium form sprawled its natural width past the intended ~660px column. Both
    are now bounded — the prompt label caps at 48 chars, and the form column is
    wrapped in a MaxWidthBin(720) — so the result pane keeps its side slot on a
    wide window and only stacks below on a genuinely narrow one.

